{"ticker":"GATEWAY","symbol":"GATEWAY","instrumentId":3022908,"name":"Gateway Distriparks","industry":"NSE-Transportation-Logistics","about":"Gateway Distriparks is a prominent Indian logistics company providing integrated container logistics and warehousing solutions. The company operates container freight stations (CFS), inland container depots (ICD), and rail-linked terminals, facilitating efficient movement of goods between ports and inland locations. Gateway Distriparks offers a comprehensive range of services, including container handling, warehousing, transportation, and cold chain logistics, catering to diverse industries such as automotive, pharmaceuticals, and consumer goods. With strategic locations near major ports and industrial hubs, the company ensures seamless, end-to-end logistics support for its clients. Gateway Distriparks is committed to enhancing supply chain efficiency through technology-driven solutions and reliable service.","website":"www.gatewaydistriparks.com","location":"Navi Mumbai, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:21:41.124Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":47.37,"changePct":0.3601694915254123,"week52High":64.73,"week52Low":42.87},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹2,367 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹2,223 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"329,765,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"92"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"181,938,578"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"4.22%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"1.03"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.3"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"9.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.08"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.22"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"5%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"10.04"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"7–2,180"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"11.2%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"9.39"},{"label":"Volume","value":"807,596"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,195,179"},{"label":"Master scor